---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro'
import PageHero from '../components/PageHero.astro'
import { committee } from '../data/committee'
---

<BaseLayout title="Business plan" description="ISO/TC 12's strategic business plan — published on the ISO website, periodically reviewed at plenary meetings.">
  <article class="page">
    <PageHero
      eyebrow="Strategy"
      title="Strategic Business Plan"
      lead="TC 12 maintains a Strategic Business Plan (SBP) on the ISO website. The plan is reviewed at every plenary and updated through Committee Internal Ballot."
    />

    <div class="bp-grid">
      <div class="prose-ref">
        <h3>Current plan</h3>
        <p>The Strategic Business Plan describes TC 12's scope, the global relevance of its work, the structure of its programme, and its objectives. It is reviewed at every plenary meeting.</p>
        <p>At the 23rd plenary (May 2026), the committee resolved to reformat the draft SBP (N1609) into the latest ISO template and circulate it for approval via Committee Internal Ballot.</p>

        <h3>Recent reviews</h3>
        <ul class="reviews">
          <li><span class="reviews__date num">2026-05-26</span><span>23rd plenary — draft SBP (N1609) to be reformatted to ISO template, then CIB</span></li>
          <li><span class="reviews__date num">2025-05-22</span><span>22nd plenary — update to SBP v.12, comments invited then CIB</span></li>
          <li><span class="reviews__date num">2024-05-16</span><span>21st plenary — confirmed SBP v.11 (N1488)</span></li>
          <li><span class="reviews__date num">2020-09-14</span><span>CIB approved SBP Final v.9 rev 2 (N1377)</span></li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <aside class="card">
        <p class="eyebrow">Published plan</p>
        <a href="https://www.iso.org/committee/45976.html" class="bp-link">ISO/TC 12 SBP on iso.org ↗</a>
        <p class="muted small">The current plan is hosted on the ISO website.</p>
      </aside>
    </div>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .bp-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 2rem; margin-top: 3rem; }
  @media (min-width: 1024px) { .bp-grid { grid-template-columns: 2fr 1fr; gap: 3rem; } }
  .bp-link { display: block; font-family: var(--font-display); font-size: 1.1875rem; font-weight: 500; color: var(--accent); text-decoration: none; margin: 0.625rem 0 0; }
  .bp-link:hover { text-decoration: underline; text-underline-offset: 3px; }
  .muted { color: var(--ink-muted); }
  .small { font-size: 0.8125rem; line-height: 1.55; margin: 0.75rem 0 0; }
  .reviews { list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 1rem 0 0; }
  .reviews li { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 8rem 1fr; gap: 1rem; padding: 0.75rem 0; border-top: 1px solid var(--rule); font-size: 0.9375rem; }
  @media (max-width: 640px) { .reviews li { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 0.25rem; } }
  .reviews__date { color: var(--accent); font-size: 0.8125rem; }
</style>
